          The Small Business AI Adoption Playbook
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
          Your team is already using AI. Somebody is drafting emails in ChatGPT, somebody else is summarizing a contract in Claude, and your software vendor just switched on an AI assistant nobody asked for. The question isn't whether to adopt AI. It's whether the adoption is organized enough to save real hours without creating new risk.
        </p>
